# LexLoop core

- Read [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) for full conventions.
- Use `./do` / `backend/do` / `frontend/do` / `infrastructure/do` — do not invent scripts.
- After API changes: `./do update-api-schema`, then update `frontend/src/api/index.ts`.
- Pass `course_uuid` from route/UI context; do not hardcode course IDs.
- Teachers: Google OAuth; students: username/password (no email/name). Domain routes need a principal.
- Infra is AWS + shared tck-labs Postgres RDS (not Supabase/Azure/DynamoDB).
- Deployed auth secrets live in Secrets Manager (`lex/auth/<env>`); local uses `backend/.env`.
